  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: out-of-bounds repeat stack access in Onigmo\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-110264.patch: reject patterns whose\n       range-repeat or null-check count overflows the internal ID type in\n       include/ruby/onigmo.h, regcomp.c, regerror.c.\n     - CVE-2026-110264\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: wrapped jump offsets in Onigmo\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-93577-CVE-2026-97229.patch: check the\n       quantifier expansion size without integer overflow and reject compiled\n       programs too big for their offset type in regcomp.c, regint.h.\n     - CVE-2026-93577\n     - CVE-2026-97229",
